msgid "Output: `LIGOTimeGPS`, `datetime`, and `tconvert` return values"
msgstr "出力: `LIGOTimeGPS` / `datetime` / `tconvert` の返り値"

#: ../../how-to/time_utilities.md:73 98030be64ad34d60805d97c80622a0dd
